{{-
  sku   = model.props.sku ? model.props.sku.name : null
  tier  = model.props.sku ? model.props.sku.tier : null
  extra_fm = ""
  if sku
    extra_fm = "sku: " + sku
  end
  if tier
    extra_fm = extra_fm + (extra_fm != "" ? "\n" : "") + "tier: " + tier
  end
-}}
# {{ model.name }}

## ℹ️ Configuration

| Property | Value |
|---|---|
{{ if sku -}}
| **SKU** | `{{ sku }}` |
{{ end -}}
{{ if tier -}}
| **Tier** | `{{ tier }}` |
{{ end -}}

## 🌐 Inbound / Upstream Connections

{{ for edge in model.inbound | filter_by_labels "frontend ip" "public ip" -}}
* **Public IP:** {{ edge.wiki }}
{{ end -}}
{{ for edge in model.inbound | filter_by_labels "a record" "cname" -}}
* **DNS Mapping:** {{ edge.wiki }}
{{ end -}}

## 🔀 Outbound / Downstream Targets

{{ for edge in model.outbound | filter_by_label "backend pool" -}}
* **Backend:** {{ edge.wiki }}
{{ end -}}
{{ if !(model.outbound | has_label "backend pool") -}}
*No backend targets resolved.*
{{ end }}

## 🛡️ Security & Monitoring

{{ for edge in model.outbound | filter_by_label "waf policy" -}}
* **WAF Policy:** {{ edge.wiki }}
{{ end -}}
{{ if !(model.outbound | has_label "waf policy") -}}
*No WAF policy attached.*
{{ end }}
